
The d010cmd file just runs one window of an fep calculation.
1,2-dichloroethane is perturbed from phi(Cl-C-C-Cl) = 10 degrees
to phi = 0 and 20 degrees.

Note the reaction coordinate is the dihedral angle for atom 6;
it has been moved from the list of variable dihedrals to the 
list of additional dihedrals.

Time required: 1.3 hours on an R5000 SGI.

The fullpmf subdirectory contains the files needed to run the entire
pmf via one job submission.

See the alanine directory for scanning phi or psi for alanine dipeptide.
